# 🚀 User Defined Package

We can create our own packages.

---

## Folder Structure

```text id="e4hfgq"
MyProject/
│
├── main.go
└── calculator/
      └── add.go
```

---

## add.go

```go id="n7aaj8"
package calculator

func Add(a, b int) int {
    return a + b
}
```

---

## main.go

```go id="3p49u4"
package main

import (
    "fmt"
    "MyProject/calculator"
)

func main() {
    fmt.Println(calculator.Add(10, 20))
}
```

### Output

```text id="mk6gvz"
30
```

