# 📊 Common Go Commands

| Command        | Purpose             |
| -------------- | ------------------- |
| go run main.go | Run Program         |
| go build       | Build Executable    |
| go mod init    | Create Module       |
| go mod tidy    | Manage Dependencies |
| go get         | Download Package    |
| go list -m all | List Modules        |

---

# 📊 Package vs Module

| Package                    | Module                         |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Collection of Go Files     | Collection of Packages         |
| Used for Code Organization | Used for Dependency Management |
| Smaller Unit               | Larger Unit                    |

